  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nepal Emission Reductions Program in the Terai Arc Landscape</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to make payments to the Recipient for measured, reported and verified Emission Reductions related to reduced deforestation, forest degradation and the enhancement of forest carbon stocks (ER payments) in Terai Arc Landscape, and to distribute ER payments in accordance with an agreed-upon benefit sharing plan.</narrative>
  </description>
